  "review_basis": "Published SLC, FLM, and Tesla cooperative-steering additions. Every incumbent wire field descriptor and enum prefix was independently checked unchanged; only the exact typed deltas listed here are permitted. Tesla adds steeringLimitInfo @39 at pointer slot 6 using the existing SteeringLimitInfo type. ToyotaCruise @38 retains pointer slot 5, type, and default; only its declaration codeOrder changes from 38 to 39. Published vision stop-sign addition appends VisionObservation.stopSigns @12 at pointer slot 2 with StopObservation type 0xb41e843c9023fcf8 and a null struct default. All 12 incumbent descriptors and nested Status/Stream types remain unchanged; data words stay 6 and pointers grow from 2 to 3. Old-reader relay preserves the populated stop observation and incumbent fields."
}
